                <figcaption class="photo__caption" title="Ellie Blackburn poses for a photo during the 2023 AFLW captains' day on August 21, 2023. Picture: AFL Photos">
                    <div class="photo__icon">
	<svg class="icon camera-icon" aria-hidden="true">
			<use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/resources/v5.54.8/i/svg-output/icons.svg#icn-camera"></use>
	</svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="photo__caption-inner">Ellie Blackburn poses for a photo during the 2023 AFLW captains' day on August 21, 2023. Picture: AFL Photos</span>
                </figcaption>
        </div>
    </figure>
</div><p><strong>Hawthorn v Essendon at Kinetic Stadium, 7.15pm AEST</strong> </p>
<p>Hawthorn and Essendon made their AFLW debuts against one another in an emotion packed evening at Marvel Stadium in front of more than 12,000 people a year ago. That night midfield star Maddy Prespakis won 26 disposals and Bombers co-captain Bonnie Toogood kicked two goals to lead the side, which would go on to be the most successful of the four expansion teams. This time things look a little different. Essendon must head to the Hawks' home in Frankston, which is more susceptible to the elements, and take on an outfit that has added two former All-Australians in Emily Bates and Greta Bodey. </p><div class="articleWidget center">


        <section
            id="50535c23-a28b-43be-b113-f6bcbba8c473"
            class="content-link embeddable-widget embeddable-widget--full-width-mobile "
        >
            <a class="content-link__link" href="/aflw/featured/1020317/giddey-mitch-and-becs-pitch-inside-hawks-20-month-lion-hunt" target="_blank">
                <div class="content-link__category-wrapper">
	<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true">
			<use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/resources/v5.54.8/i/svg-output/icons.svg#icn-news"></use>
	</svg>
                    <div class="content-link__category"></div>
	<svg class="icon content-link__category-wrapper-edge" aria-hidden="true">
			<use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/resources/v5.54.8/i/svg-output/icons.svg#icn-content-label-edge"></use>
	</svg>
                </div>
                <div class="content-link__title"><span class="content-link__title-text">Giddey, Mitch and Bec's pitch: Inside Hawks' 20-month Lion hunt</span>	<svg class="icon content-link__link-icon" aria-hidden="true">
			<use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/resources/v5.54.8/i/svg-output/icons.svg#icn-arrow-right"></use>
	</svg>
</div>
            </a>
        </section>
</div><p>The Bombers will look to play a front-half game, winning the ball at the source and keeping pressure on the Hawks' defensive line. It will be congested as Hawthorn often gets caught flooding the zone where the footy lives, but Essendon must be wary of space opening up out the back and maintain a deeper defensive presence should the ball get in the hands of speedsters like Aileen Gilroy or Tahlia Fellows. </p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> The new Hawks will put on a show, but the Bombers will ultimately win out. Essendon by 11 points. </p><div class="articleWidget center">


    <figure id="dfb89af0-3c42-4d24-be60-8e715222daee" class="photo  embeddable-widget embeddable-widget--floating embeddable-widget--full-width-mobile " data-widget="lazy-load-images">
        <div class="photo__container">
            <div class="photo__wrapper placeholder placeholder--dark placeholder--medium">
    <div class="js-lazy-load lazy-image-wrapper  ">
                <!--         <picture class="photo__img object-fit-cover-picture ">
                    <source class="" srcset="https://resources.afl.com.au/photo-resources/2022/08/27/f44b5074-2357-44d1-99c0-60256ac61916/cVgzbFOi.jpg?width=410&height=230, https://resources.afl.com.au/photo-resources/2022/08/27/f44b5074-2357-44d1-99c0-60256ac61916/cVgzbFOi.jpg?width=820&height=460 2x, https://resources.afl.com.au/photo-resources/2022/08/27/f44b5074-2357-44d1-99c0-60256ac61916/cVgzbFOi.jpg?width=1230&height=690 3x" media="(max-width: 425px)">
                    <source class="" srcset="https://resources.afl.com.au/photo-resources/2022/08/27/f44b5074-2357-44d1-99c0-60256ac61916/cVgzbFOi.jpg?width=745&height=420, https://resources.afl.com.au/photo-resources/2022/08/27/f44b5074-2357-44d1-99c0-60256ac61916/cVgzbFOi.jpg?width=1490&height=840 2x, https://resources.afl.com.au/photo-resources/2022/08/27/f44b5074-2357-44d1-99c0-60256ac61916/cVgzbFOi.jpg?width=2235&height=1260 3x" media="(max-width: 768px)">
