        <div class="article__title">
            <h1 class="article__heading">Garner mastery helps Roos get hop on Saints to cruise to big win</h1>
            <p class="article__summary">
                North Melbourne secured a convincing 40-point win over St Kilda to open its season
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="article__header-footer">
            <div class="article__metadata">
                <div 
                    class="article__author-container" 
                    data-widget="bio-tracking" 
                    data-script="aflm_bio-tracking"
