            <h1 class="feature-video__title ">
                AFLW Highlights: North Melbourne v St Kilda
            </h1>

                <p class="feature-video__summary ">The Kangaroos and Saints clash in round one of the 2023 NAB AFLW Season</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    </div>
</div><p>North punished them for their profligacy with the Kangaroos kicking the first three goals of the final quarter.</p>
<p>Five-time All-Australian Garner won the first clearance of the game and within 20 seconds booted a fine goal on the run from 45m.</p><div class="articleWidget center">

    <div class="embeddable-widget embeddable-widget--full-width-mobile  ">


