</div><p><strong>NORTH MELBOURNE    </strong>3.3   5.6   5.7   8.8 (56)<br /><strong>ST KILDA</strong>                      0.0   0.0   1.4   2.4 (16)</p>
<p><strong>GOALS<br /></strong><strong>North Melbourne:</strong> King 2, Randall 2, Garner, O'Loughlin, Shierlaw, Tripodi<br /><strong>St Kilda:</strong> Patrikios, Stuart</p>
<p><strong>BEST<br /></strong><strong>North Melbourne:</strong> Garner, Riddell, Shierlaw, King, Kearney, Smith<br /><strong>St Kilda:</strong> Xenos, Priest, Patrikios, Stuart, Vesely</p>
<p><strong>INJURIES<br /></strong><strong>North Melbourne:</strong> Nil<br /><strong>St Kilda:</strong> Nil</p>
<p><strong>Crowd:</strong> 2,454 at Blundstone Arena</p><div class="articleWidget center">
